        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cute outfits, build Misha’s wardrobe and trade what you do not need!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Misha is a cheerful anime girl who is always on your desktop to brighten your day. She loves dancing, pulling funny faces and showing off new looks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Misha is crazy about cosplay - from looks inspired by iconic game and pop culture characters to just plain beautiful everyday outfits. Your job is to help her unlock, mix and complete her growing collection of costumes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every tap earns points that you can exchange for clothes. Work, play or simply type - every action slowly pushes you toward a new outfit. Hunt for rare pieces and trade duplicates with other players through the Steam Community Market. Create the most stylish look for your new friend - Misha! 💛</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868850/extras/939296bdf4c7670b5fc2ba04e0dcd44b.poster.avif?t=1786965302\" width=480 height=601 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868850/extras/939296bdf4c7670b5fc2ba04e0dcd44b.webm?t=1786965302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Click, type, play — earn points</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the mouse, press keys on your keyboard or controller — the counter grows with every action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868850/extras/7ed125e85becc0ec69df3b9a56cb2b6c.poster.avif?t=1786965302\" width=900 height=1000 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868850/extras/7ed125e85becc0ec69df3b9a56cb2b6c.webm?t=1786965302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exchange points for outfits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the timer expires, a box appears. Click it and trade your accumulated points — receive a random outfit for your collection. To see how much time is left until the exchange, click the pedestal. The timer also appears in place of the points counter after a few seconds of inactivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868850/extras/2b77b5b7fdf490f83ac3d94c7818106e.poster.avif?t=1786965302\" width=1170 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868850/extras/2b77b5b7fdf490f83ac3d94c7818106e.webm?t=1786965302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dress Misha</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the interface, choose an item, and click — Misha instantly tries on the new look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868850/extras/bbbcc131f3f7e7de0d66e2b9be9bb09b.poster.avif?t=1786965302\" width=1170 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868850/extras/bbbcc131f3f7e7de0d66e2b9be9bb09b.webm?t=1786965302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trade duplicates or sell</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade duplicates for rarer items or sell them on the <strong>Steam Community Market</strong> (in the release version). Go to the exchange tab. Click the auto-fill button or choose yourself which items to trade. Confirm the trade and receive an item one rarity tier higher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868850/extras/fe5cf2a1df5eb7c0a3595a2991f2d23b.poster.avif?t=1786965302\" width=1170 height=990 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868850/extras/fe5cf2a1df5eb7c0a3595a2991f2d23b.webm?t=1786965302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cute outfits, build Misha’s wardrobe and trade what you do not need!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Misha is a cheerful anime girl who is always on your desktop to brighten your day. She loves dancing, pulling funny faces and showing off new looks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Misha is crazy about cosplay - from looks inspired by iconic game and pop culture characters to just plain beautiful everyday outfits. Your job is to help her unlock, mix and complete her growing collection of costumes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every tap earns points that you can exchange for clothes. Work, play or simply type - every action slowly pushes you toward a new outfit. Hunt for rare pieces and trade duplicates with other players through the Steam Community Market. Create the most stylish look for your new friend - Misha! 💛</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868850/extras/939296bdf4c7670b5fc2ba04e0dcd44b.poster.avif?t=1786965302\" width=480 height=601 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868850/extras/939296bdf4c7670b5fc2ba04e0dcd44b.webm?t=1786965302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Click, type, play — earn points</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the mouse, press keys on your keyboard or controller — the counter grows with every action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868850/extras/7ed125e85becc0ec69df3b9a56cb2b6c.poster.avif?t=1786965302\" width=900 height=1000 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868850/extras/7ed125e85becc0ec69df3b9a56cb2b6c.webm?t=1786965302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exchange points for outfits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the timer expires, a box appears. Click it and trade your accumulated points — receive a random outfit for your collection. To see how much time is left until the exchange, click the pedestal. The timer also appears in place of the points counter after a few seconds of inactivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868850/extras/2b77b5b7fdf490f83ac3d94c7818106e.poster.avif?t=1786965302\" width=1170 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868850/extras/2b77b5b7fdf490f83ac3d94c7818106e.webm?t=1786965302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dress Misha</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the interface, choose an item, and click — Misha instantly tries on the new look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868850/extras/bbbcc131f3f7e7de0d66e2b9be9bb09b.poster.avif?t=1786965302\" width=1170 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868850/extras/bbbcc131f3f7e7de0d66e2b9be9bb09b.webm?t=1786965302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trade duplicates or sell</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade duplicates for rarer items or sell them on the <strong>Steam Community Market</strong> (in the release version). Go to the exchange tab. Click the auto-fill button or choose yourself which items to trade. Confirm the trade and receive an item one rarity tier higher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868850/extras/fe5cf2a1df5eb7c0a3595a2991f2d23b.poster.avif?t=1786965302\" width=1170 height=990 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868850/extras/fe5cf2a1df5eb7c0a3595a2991f2d23b.webm?t=1786965302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
